From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 07:17:13 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 08/18] sdl1: volume keys (Alt+F7/Alt+F8 and the keyboard's
 volume keys)

Alt+F7 and Alt+F8, and the keyboard's Volume Down, Volume Up and Mute
keys (Linux key codes 114, 115 and 113, which the framebuffer console
hands SDL as scancodes), change the sound card's main volume through
amixer in 5% steps, show the level on screen and keep it in
linapple.conf as Master Volume.
